  "content": "<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=png,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-melodies/banner.png\" alt=\"螢幕截圖\">\n<p>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fimmersive-melodies\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Modrinth\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-NA?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=000000&amp;color=00AF5C\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-melodies\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"CurseForge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-NA?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=000000&amp;color=F16436\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/agxcvAdj2a\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-NA?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=000000&amp;color=5865F2\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersiveMelodies\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Github\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Github-NA?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;color=181717\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252fproject%252fimmersive-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"通過 Crowdin 翻譯\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Crowdin-NA?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=crowdin&amp;color=2E3340\">\n</a>\n</p>\n\n<p>\n無論你想創建樂團、捉弄朋友，還是讓骷髏在進攻你的基地時演奏《Megalovania》，這個模組都能滿足你。\n</p>\n\n<p>\n在 7 種樂器上演奏 25 首內建歌曲，或者透過簡單的<strong>遊戲內拖放</strong>或使用資料包上傳您自己的旋律。\n支援多人遊戲！支援 MIDI 和 ABC 文件，網路上有數百萬個此類文件可供使用。\n是的，小鳥會跳舞。\n</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/mcr/atlas?minecraft_version=1.20.1&amp;locations=_immersive_melodies:instruments&amp;dependencies=https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersiveMelodies/tree/1.20.1&amp;resolution=48&amp;background=fancy&amp;row_size=8\" alt=\"生成的圖集圖片\"></p>\n\n<span><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/YW1wXcHp_nA?wmode=transparent\" height=\"480\" width=\"836\"></iframe></span></span>\n\n<img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-melodies/screenshots/screen1.jpg\" alt=\"螢幕截圖\">\n<img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-melodies/screenshots/screen3.jpg\" alt=\"螢幕截圖\">\n<img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-melodies/screenshots/screen2.jpg\" alt=\"螢幕截圖\">\n\n<p>精美的紙張紋理由 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/soytutta/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">soytutta</a> 提供！</p>\n\n<p>所有配方在收集一個銅錠後皆會解鎖，並可在原版配方書中查看。</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/mcr/recipes?minecraft_version=1.20.1&amp;locations=immersive_melodies:.*&amp;dependencies=https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersiveMelodies/tree/1.20.1&amp;resolution=32&amp;animated=False&amp;row_width=835\" alt=\"生成的配方圖片\"></p>\n\n<h1>Immersive 系列</h1>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-armors\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Armors&amp;description=大量獨特且忠於原版的盔甲套裝。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Immersive Armors\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-aircraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Aircraft&amp;description=一系列用於旅行、運輸和探索的鄉村風飛行器！&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Immersive Aircraft\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-melodies\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Melodies&amp;description=在各種樂器上演奏自訂旋律，順便捉弄你的朋友！&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-melodies/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Immersive Melodies\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-paintings\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Paintings&amp;description=拖放、像素化並懸掛精美的藝術品。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Immersive Paintings\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-optimization\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Optimization&amp;description=輕量級的實體刻排程器，可將 TPS 提升一倍。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-optimization/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Immersive Optimization\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/selectivebounds\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=SelectiveBounds&amp;description=在不相關時隱藏難看的方塊選擇輪廓。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/selectivebounds/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"SelectiveBounds\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/man-of-many-planes\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Man of Many Planes&amp;description=為 Immersive Aircraft 設計的一系列附加飛行器，並考慮了 Create 模組支援。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/man-of-many-planes/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Man of Many Planes\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-machinery\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Machinery&amp;description=一系列用於運輸、挖掘和自動化的鄉村風機械。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-machinery/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Immersive Machinery\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-furniture\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Furniture&amp;description=在遊戲中製作自訂精美家具，或從龐大的線上圖書館中選擇。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-furniture/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Immersive Furniture\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-gateways\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Gateways&amp;description=散落在主世界各處、被遺忘已久的神祕傳送門。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-gateways/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Immersive Gateways\">\n</a></p>\n\n<h1>附加元件</h1>\n<p>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252farids-immersive-resprites\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Arids Immersive Resprites&amp;description=專為 Immersive Melodies 和 Immersive Paintings 模組設計的紋理重繪！&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/common/icons/arids-immersive-resprites.webp&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Arids Immersive Resprites\">\n</a></p>\n</div><p><img src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/pixel.png?immersive_pages_hash=7d24f163ffd196ee72797abdd95b5b6a\" alt=\"頁面哈希值，便於頁面部署。\"></p>",
